    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeagiischoodiga fuga Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloolan ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, ramoorsiina jeagiischoodiga fuga Israeli, ramoorsiina nea giyeeshi saawa, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ‘Jeagiischoodiga fuga Israeli ashageada, gea inyeessa ghoang'aata geat, heapi? Mamiisiina gideaba jeagiischoodiga ghoahaaghwa gisilga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoayaaji gea riisheadi, nea gookwealayi eagweega sisna buudeega nyaawa. Nea goonuuseadi gea riisheadi, nea moohaaghwani gisilga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gea miyeani miyootawa uurjeenga nea miyoohaabwa gea miyeani, nea mii arada gea giishachi, nea miyookghuumni gea sihoan, nea mii agasa gea sihoan, geaghus gideaba goombaliischi aba uurda ea ng'weaninda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwadarda aba gideaba manda jeagiischoocheanda, ak ghoah hamita diyeanga dareabeeta, ak ghwadarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gisilgeasu gwaneay aba giijeega sean, ea gilinyoo ea iheenga heayeeniga geawi, gisilgeasu ghwadarda aba jeeda ng'eanyiisean. Ak ea manda siida anyaashta ghana gawa gasooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi agooga jeagiischoodiga ooleeysiiniit ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideabideati, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, aba gideaba gisilgeasu ghayi easanga, nea gisilgeasu ghoah hamita diyeanga dareabeeta aba gideaba manda jeagiischoocheanda nea eara jeagiischoodigeasu, ea mii gaweay gagasa gisilgeasu. Ak jeagiischoodiga ghoarear geat nea gabwageat, nea moahaaghwa gisilgeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeagiischoodiga, asi aba badaydeaba nih ooleeysiiniit ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ng'ula, aniini geawooschi haweewa jeagiischoodiga ak gisilgeasu gaydang'al saawa. Ak gaydanung' ghwanung'waada haghweeni bea gisilgeani, nea jeagiischoodiga, ea maygut ghoarear geat, ak gaydaaghu gisilgeasu aba ghuusiga nyaawa, ak ea maygudu ea hamita nyaawa gil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeagiischoocheanda miy",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ng'ula, aniineesean, asaha, aniini gaydawa dagasa gisilgeasu ak ghaahaaghwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji gidaweeda jeagiischoocheanda gagasa gisilgaaschi, eaweedida iimida bugusta gisilgaaschi dabwaarda, ea gichea dagasiida gisilgeasu gil. Ak gaydaaghu aba heeda dabarsa sean, aba eaweeda shamooghuutka ea misaneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydearuuteawa jeeda eemoojiga, ak ghaabwadi geat aba darooraka sean, ak gaydanung' gabiikta ng'eanyiida nyaawa. Ak gaydaahaaghwa aba uhuuda giijeega Israeli, ea ghuusiga ghealooniga beega, ea ng'eanyiisean abiita buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydaahaaghwa haghweeda miy, aba iheenga giijeega geawi bea Israeli, abeeda gayghoah muhealeeda nyaawa. Aba hoowa gaygwalla jeeda muhealeeda miy, ak gayghwaak nyeega miyaasiin aba iheenga giijeega Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniineesean gaydaahaaghwa gisilgeasu, ak gaydealuul, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydawa dagasa gea rooda, nea geadeelu gea ghayi sihoan, gaydarada gea giishachi, ak gaydanung' gamajeegiidi gea miyeani, nea gea riisheadi ea gea mideawa uurjeenga gaydadatas, ak gaydaahaaghwiita gida haguuw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea aba ng'asheegeagwa, ea hawandeanyu, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, Ng'ula, gaydaalaach ng'asheega gisilleanda ea gisilleanda, lagweenda ea ghwarayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeedeang'wa gwanda gea ak hamita miy, ak ghoadataschi giika abidiin. Ghoaleayi beega miyaas, nea gea lagaan ghoadataschi aba geeshangeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba ng'asheega gisilgeasu, saawa ghwaak suh oalaapchi aba geeshangeagwean. Ak ghwali beega oadataschi aba geeshangeagwean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA saawa, Ng'ula, aniini gaydaalaach ng'asheega gisilga riisheadi ea gisilga ribeadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba noogutguti aba gisheajeega ea aba hamarjeeda, nea ghoabwarji gea beadi aba gujakeagwa, bwak ea oataarda gwasheagiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aniini gaydaaghu hawandeanyu, nea maygut gabiikta ghoah easanga, ak gaydeargweaksa gilinyoo ea gisilleanda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak saawa gaydanyaksa jeagiischoocheanjagi Dawdi was siideanyu bea gadiyeeda dea jea ghoahaaghwa saawa gil. Gayghoahaaghwa saawa ak gayghoah jeagiischoocheanda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aniini NG'UTAMIIDA gaydoaw ASEETA nyaawa, nea siideanyu bea gadiyeeda was Dawdi, gayghoah siida haw aba heeda nyaawa, ng'asheesu gearugu aniini NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak gaydasin sea saawa neajeeda hoyyoo, nea ghaanung' ea mudugwanda diyeanga ng'weani aba heeda nyaawa. Ak gaygoobiida dareapcheeda nea gaba seayu, nea gwalla dareabeeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydanung' goobiida murdeeda giijeedeanyu ghaydit ak ghaadawji ghawooda. Ak gaydanung' ghwanyas roopta aba damandaanyi ak gajea roopta mideawa ghawooda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geediga madamnyeanda gaygwaji haghweagaaschi, ak gaygaba seayu aba jeeda ng'eanyiida nyaawa, abeeda gayghwanal gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA, inyas geang'achi ghealoodida sirasa gheatkweaka nyaawaan, ak gaydaaghu aba geatinga fugiga nung' gaweay soomjeanduumeedean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea maygut ghoah soomjooga eemoojiga, nea mayghwaak diyeanga ng'eanyiida, saawa gaygoobiida nea gaba seayu, nea maygut gwanda siida jea ghang'uda muuwda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydaadaw madameega mideawa sururuuda, aba gideaba adagudu ghabwar jalooda aba hiji bea ng'eanyiidean, nea adagudu gafool eemoojiga suuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwanal gideaba aniini NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa gil. Geandeayi sea saawa, ak saawa fuga Israeli fugeasu gil, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak agooga gisilgeasu, gisilga haghweedeanyu, goowooschi fugeasu, ak aniini geawooschi ASEETEANG'WA, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
